flowchart LR

  subgraph Vivienda
    M1[Pronext WA1102<br/>Meter A]
    M2[Pronext WA1102<br/>Meter B]
  end

  subgraph Edge["ESP8266 (D1 Mini)"]
    ESP[ACDC Meter Firmware<br/>- Pulses<br/>- Watts<br/>- kWh<br/>- OTA<br/>- Basic UI]
  end

  subgraph Cloud["ThingSpeak (Backup)"]
    TS[(Time Series<br/>Cloud Backup)]
  end

  subgraph LAN["Mini PC (Linux)"]
    INGEST[Ingest Script<br/>cron / systemd]
    DB[(energy.db<br/>SQLite)]
    ANALYSIS[Analysis Engine<br/>- Baseline<br/>- Events<br/>- Devices]
    UI[Local Web UI<br/>Charts + Events]
  end

  %% Connections
  M1 -->|Pulses| ESP
  M2 -->|Pulses| ESP

  ESP -->|HTTP /data<br/>near real-time| INGEST
  INGEST -->|INSERT| DB

  DB --> ANALYSIS
  ANALYSIS --> DB

  DB --> UI

  ESP -->|15s HTTP| TS
  TS -->|Recovery Sync| INGEST
